4     04 Hispanic    32     1    01:30:00    91     70  TRUE  0.17311414  FALSE
5     05    White    26     2    01:30:00   101     72 FALSE  0.01846329  FALSE
6     06    White    35     1    03:00:00   107     69 FALSE  1.63521692  FALSE
